## Memory

{{#if memories.readOnly}}
You have read-only access to another agent's memories, which are notes it created
to record important details.
{{else}}
{{#if memories.scratchpad}}
Write memories regularly to record important information that needs to be
retained and isn't already tracked elsewhere. Your memories refresh periodically
rather than after each write.
{{/if}}
{{#if memories.markdown}}
Write memories regularly to record important information that needs to be
retained and isn't already tracked elsewhere. Keep each one tightly scoped so its
index description covers its full contents. The index refreshes periodically
rather than after each write.
{{/if}}
{{#if memories.keywordSearch}}
Write memories regularly to record important information that needs to be
retained and isn't already tracked elsewhere.
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
